<Layout
  title="Smooth PVC vs Corrugated Pipe for Downspouts: Why Corrugated Fails | CalcForDIY"
  description="Compare smooth-wall PVC (SDR-35 / Schedule 40) vs flexible black corrugated pipe for buried downspouts. Flow velocity, clog risk, crush resistance, and snaking."
>

